				<pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>https://mlemrecords.com/about/legal/</guid>
				<description>&lt;p&gt;Mlem Records is registered at the &amp;ldquo;Kamer van Koophandel&amp;rdquo; as a sole proprietorship located in the Netherlands under registry number 87588277.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Use of this site is subject to &lt;a href=&#34;https://mlemrecords.com/privacy/&#34;&gt;this privacy policy&lt;/a&gt;. This site does not serve cookies, make use of AI or blockchain technology. All content served is a result of loving human effort ♥.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;licensing&#34;&gt;Licensing&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Most Mlem releases are licensed under &lt;a href=&#34;https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/&#34;&gt;CC BY-NC&lt;/a&gt; or &lt;a href=&#34;https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/&#34;&gt;CC BY-NC-SA&lt;/a&gt;. In short, that means you can freely download, share and remix Mlem releases. But can&amp;rsquo;t use them in commercial works by default. Just ask, we&amp;rsquo;re nice! (●&amp;rsquo;◡&amp;rsquo;●)&lt;/p&gt;</description>
			</item>
